  "description": "Change of Use from Bedsits to Single  Family Dwelling House. Demolition of rear extension and the erection of a new rear extension with basement. Erection of a single storey garage extension and new rear roof extension. Erection of a 'roof lantern' over staircase to roof of building with new window layout to rear.",
